 "name_en": "Convergent Invoicing – Intercompany Settlement (6WC)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Convergent Invoicing – Intercompany Settlement (6WC)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio5113d64b64ef48bfbf82a0e57695132b\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio5113d64b64ef48bfbf82a0e57695132b__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item enables cross-company-code business between two companies that belong to the same corporate group. It allows the creation of an intercompany invoice for subscription and usage services.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Based on billing data received from an external source, the system determines if an intercompany settlement needs to take place, calculates the respective charges, and triggers the intercompany invoice and the postings in the supplying and receiving company code.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio5113d64b64ef48bfbf82a0e57695132b__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Calculate intercompany charge and create ICO billable items</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute ICO billing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute ICO invoicing</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio5113d64b64ef48bfbf82a0e57695132b__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Leverage intercompany processing that is fully integrated in contract accounting and invoicing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve flexibility in price determination and tax key determination for intercompany bills</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>集中开发票 – 公司间结算 (6WC)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio5113d64b64ef48bfbf82a0e57695132b\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio5113d64b64ef48bfbf82a0e57695132b__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目支持属于同一公司集团的两个公司之间的跨公司代码业务。它允许为订阅和使用服务创建公司间发票。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">根据从外部源接收的开票数据，系统确定是否需要进行公司间结算、计算相应费用并触发公司间发票以及供货和收货公司代码中的过账。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio5113d64b64ef48bfbf82a0e57695132b__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">计算公司间费用并创建 ICO 可开票项目</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行 ICO 开票</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行 ICO 开发票</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio5113d64b64ef48bfbf82a0e57695132b__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">利用完全集成到合同会计和开发票中的公司间处理。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高公司间账单的价格确定和税务代码确定的灵活性。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
